  "author_source_limitations": [
    "Empty steps: no explicit issue, zero ratio, needs-evidence status.",
    "Missing step evidence: an issue is appended for the empty evidence tuple.",
    "Duplicate, gapped, non-one-start and reversed orders share an exact-list contiguous-order check; no sorting or repair.",
    "Confidence outside [0,1], infinities and float NaN fail the range comparison; no explicit type validation or calibration; nonnumeric confidence can raise TypeError.",
    "grounded requires at least one direct evidence item globally, not direct support for each step; the example approval step remains nondirect.",
    "Direct ratio is evidence-item based, rounded to two decimals, unweighted by confidence; it is not step coverage.",
    "Prose includes artifacts among direct proof, but the example runbook is marked direct=False; preserve source inconsistency.",
    "Dataclass omits dedicated trigger/input/output/authority fields from the discovery table; no source-authenticity or causal validation.",
    "Branch and variant handling are exercise tasks and not implemented in the shipped linear audit.",
    "Original six tests do not cover all listed edge cases; supplemental checks must be distinct.",
    "Main writes to an output path derived from __file__; changing cwd is insufficient. Entire lesson including outputs must be copied before any later run."
  ],
